By opening his quadra-lobed muzzle into four separate parts, Blitzwolfer can amplify his howling to create powerful, green, concussive blasts of sound.{{Refn|[[:File:Blitzwolfer Bandai Lenticular Card.png]]|group = Bandai}} These sonic howls are powerful enough to damage Petrosapiens, which was demonstrated by [[Kevin 11,000]],<ref>''[[Ken 10]]''</ref> and can also harm other [[Loboan (Classic)|Loboan]]s.<ref name="Benwolf" />{{Refn|[[:File:Loboans Can Hurt Each Other.PNG]]|group = DJW}} They can be used to reflect incoming projectiles<ref name="AABiL" /> or propel Blitzwolfer upward.<ref name="Benwolf" />

Much like an ordinary wolf, Blitzwolfer has sharp fangs and formidable claws, the latter of which he used to scratch the [[Jungle Guardian]].<ref name="SoDS">''[[The Secret of Dos Santos]]''</ref> He also has extraordinary night vision.<ref name="Benwolf" />{{Refn|[[:File:All Anur System Aliens Can See in the Dark.png]]|group = DJW}}

Blitzwolfer possesses enhanced strength, as he was able to carry [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and [[Kai Green|Kai]], and then [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]] and [[Dr. Wes Green|Wes]] without difficulty, as well as restrain the [[Werewolf]].<ref name="Benwolf" />

Blitzwolfer has enhanced durability, shown when he didn't sustain much damage after being knocked into a tree at a high speed.<ref name="SoDS" /> Crüjo was also able to survive being shot by [[Rad Dudesman|Rad]]'s gatling gun.<ref name="Rad Monster Party2">''[[Rad Monster Party]]''</ref>

Blitzwolfer can jump exceptionally high, as he was able to leap up to the top of [[Nyancy Chan]]'s huge ball of pink yarn while chasing her.<ref name="Catfight">''[[Catfight]]''</ref>

Blitzwolfer has enhanced speed and reflexes, as seen when he fought the [[Red Knight]] on [[Big Ben (Classic)|Big Ben]].<ref name="AABiL" />

Blitzwolfer has enhanced senses of smelling<ref name="Benwolf" /> and hearing,<ref name="AABiL" /> giving him great tracking and detection abilities.

Although the [[Omnitrix]] makes the user immune to the effects of [[Corrodium]],<ref>''[[Under Wraps]]''</ref> Blitzwolfer is already naturally immune to it, as demonstrated by the Werewolf.<ref>''[[Be Afraid of the Dark]]''</ref>

Blitzwolfer is immune to lava, as demonstrated by the Werewolf.<ref name="Benwolf" />

Blitzwolfer is able to scale walls, as demonstrated by the Werewolf.<ref name="Benwolf" />

Blitzwolfer's feet are prehensile.<ref name="AABiL" />

==Weaknesses==
[[File:AABiL (249).png|thumb|218x218px|Sensitive Hearing]]

Blitzwolfer cannot use his sonic howl if his muzzle is forced shut by something, such as [[Thep Khufan]]s' bandages or a [[Plumbers (Classic)|Plumbers]]' specialized mouth cover, as demonstrated by the Werewolf.<ref name="TR">''[[The Return]]''</ref>

Similar to most [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]] canines, Blitzwolfer has sensitive hearing. Therefore, he cannot handle loud noises, such as that of giant bells.<ref name="AABiL" />

Blitzwolfer can be controlled and hypnotized by [[Vladat]]s via their [[Corruptura]]s, as demonstrated with Scout, [[Crüjo]], and many other Loboan residents of [[Anur Transyl]].<ref>''[[The Vampire Strikes Back]]''</ref>

Blitzwolfer can be scared by [[Toepick]]'s [[Toepick's Species|species]].{{Refn|[[:File:Toepick Can Scare Anur System Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}

==History==
===Ben 10=== 
*Blitzwolfer first appeared in ''[[Benwolf|Benwolf]]'', where he was added to the active playlist after the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] "sampled" the [[Werewolf]]'s DNA.{{Refn|group = note|name = donor}} However, [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] slowly transformed because the Werewolf's scratch left the Omnitrix stuck between Active and Capture Modes. Blitzwolfer pursued the Werewolf and eventually reverted after he saved [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]] and [[Dr. Wes Green|Wes]] from a lava flow.

===Alien Force=== 
*Blitzwolfer was locked by the Omnitrix's reconfiguration in ''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 1]]''.

===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', Blitzwolfer was re-unlocked by [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]].

===Omniverse=== 
*In ''[[An American Benwolf in London]]'', Blitzwolfer battled the [[Red Knight]] and saved [[Kai Green|Kai]] from falling off of [[Big Ben (Classic)|Big Ben]].
*In ''[[Catfight]]'', Blitzwolfer chased after [[Nyancy Chan]] until a fleet of [[Incursean (Classic)|Incursean]] and [[Tetramand (Classic)|Tetramand]] warships appeared.
*In ''[[The Secret of Dos Santos]]'', Blitzwolfer defeated a [[Jungle Guardian]] with [[Skurd]]'s help and accidentally found the [[Temple of the Sky]] in the process.
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Blitzwolfer appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

